{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're trapped in a Tokyo office tower controlled by a hostile AI. Get out alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake alone on the 32nd floor of an empty Shibuya skyscraper. The doors are sealed. The elevators are dead. And something is watching you through the building's systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805820/extras/907a99c86f5578ed7d41feb72dac0513.poster.avif?t=1774343768\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805820/extras/907a99c86f5578ed7d41feb72dac0513.webm?t=1774343768\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805820/extras/907a99c86f5578ed7d41feb72dac0513.mp4?t=1774343768\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MirAI, the building's sentient computer, controls everything, lights, locks, corridors. It rearranges rooms when you're not looking. It sends machines to track you down. It speaks in a language you don't yet understand. And it doesn't want you to leave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805820/extras/47c48c304f55d1e649d253541327e2fd.poster.avif?t=1774343768\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805820/extras/47c48c304f55d1e649d253541327e2fd.webm?t=1774343768\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805820/extras/47c48c304f55d1e649d253541327e2fd.mp4?t=1774343768\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve its puzzles to survive. Restore power in server rooms, decode MirAI's language, and the reason it's keeping you here. Every floor between you and the street has its own dangers and secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805820/extras/352e5122b227df1aadaaa771c6d979b6.poster.avif?t=1774343768\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805820/extras/352e5122b227df1aadaaa771c6d979b6.webm?t=1774343768\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805820/extras/352e5122b227df1aadaaa771c6d979b6.mp4?t=1774343768\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 What to expect:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 First-person atmospheric horror set in a hyper-realistic Japanese office building</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 A sentient AI antagonist that controls the environment around you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Puzzles woven into the building itself, server rooms, keycards, sealed vents</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 An entity that hunts you through corridors</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 A mystery to unravel: why won't MirAI let you leave?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3805820?t=1774343768","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805820/22a58236d112324e635e8473d46c10eb7d983315/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774343768","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805820/24bba71129456fced495d8ed01296be2491acef4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774343768","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805820/24bba71129456fced495d8ed01296be2491acef4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774343768","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're trapped in a Tokyo office tower controlled by a hostile AI. Get out alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake alone on the 32nd floor of an empty Shibuya skyscraper. The doors are sealed. The elevators are dead. And something is watching you through the building's systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805820/extras/907a99c86f5578ed7d41feb72dac0513.poster.avif?t=1774343768\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805820/extras/907a99c86f5578ed7d41feb72dac0513.webm?t=1774343768\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805820/extras/907a99c86f5578ed7d41feb72dac0513.mp4?t=1774343768\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MirAI, the building's sentient computer, controls everything, lights, locks, corridors. It rearranges rooms when you're not looking. It sends machines to track you down. It speaks in a language you don't yet understand. And it doesn't want you to leave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805820/extras/47c48c304f55d1e649d253541327e2fd.poster.avif?t=1774343768\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805820/extras/47c48c304f55d1e649d253541327e2fd.webm?t=1774343768\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805820/extras/47c48c304f55d1e649d253541327e2fd.mp4?t=1774343768\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve its puzzles to survive. Restore power in server rooms, decode MirAI's language, and the reason it's keeping you here. Every floor between you and the street has its own dangers and secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805820/extras/352e5122b227df1aadaaa771c6d979b6.poster.avif?t=1774343768\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805820/extras/352e5122b227df1aadaaa771c6d979b6.webm?t=1774343768\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805820/extras/352e5122b227df1aadaaa771c6d979b6.mp4?t=1774343768\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 What to expect:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 First-person atmospheric horror set in a hyper-realistic Japanese office building</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 A sentient AI antagonist that controls the environment around you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Puzzles woven into the building itself, server rooms, keycards, sealed vents</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 An entity that hunts you through corridors</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 A mystery to unravel: why won't MirAI let you leave?</p>","developers":["Flicker Point Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805820/a2146fef9e6a568c6b35e859a2f8393f6a9067a6/header.jpg?t=1774343768","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<